---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BrandLogos from '../../components/BrandLogos.astro';
import FlipWords from '../../components/FlipWords.astro';
import CategoryBlogFeed from '../../components/CategoryBlogFeed.astro';

const title = 'Glare Reduction Window Film Philadelphia | Anti-Glare';
const description = 'Glare reduction window film for Philadelphia reduces up to 85% of screen glare, preserves daylight, and cuts eye strain.';

const faqItems = [
  {
    question: 'How much glare does window film reduce?',
    answer: 'Our glare-reduction films filter up to 85% of glare-causing visible light while still allowing natural daylight to enter. The exact reduction depends on the film selected and your window orientation. We provide a free consultation with light measurements so you know exactly what to expect before installation.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Will I still have natural light after installing glare film?',
    answer: 'Absolutely. Unlike heavy tinted films that darken rooms significantly, our glare-control films are designed to maintain excellent natural light levels while selectively filtering the wavelengths that cause glare. Most clients report rooms feel equally bright - just without the harsh glare.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Does glare-reduction film affect TV and computer screen visibility?',
    answer: 'In fact, it significantly improves it. Once installed, you will notice that screen reflections and glare virtually disappear - even on large-screen TVs and computer monitors facing windows. This is one of the most immediately noticeable benefits of glare film installation.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can glare film be applied to skylights?',
    answer: 'Yes. Skylights are a major source of glare and heat in Philadelphia homes and commercial buildings. We assess the skylight orientation and thermal conditions to recommend the optimal film - which may include glare reduction, heat rejection, or both combined.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What is the difference between glare reduction and solar control film?',
    answer: 'Glare-reduction films focus specifically on filtering visible light wavelengths that cause screen and surface glare. Solar control films primarily target infrared heat rejection while also reducing overall light transmission. Many films combine both properties. We help you select the right film based on your primary concern - glare, heat, or both.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Is glare reduction film noticeable from the outside?',
    answer: 'No. Most glare-control films are optically clear or very lightly tinted and are virtually undetectable from street level. Low-reflectance options are specifically engineered to avoid a mirror or metallic appearance - so your building looks exactly as it did before, just with dramatically improved comfort inside.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How does glare film compare to blinds or shades?',
    answer: 'Blinds block glare by blocking light entirely - defeating the purpose of having windows. Glare reduction window film for Philadelphia homes and offices selectively filters only the wavelengths responsible for glare while preserving natural daylight, your views, and ventilation. Film works 24/7 without adjustment, requires no maintenance, and lasts 10-15 years.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How long does glare reduction window film last?',
    answer: 'Professionally installed glare reduction window film typically lasts 10-15 years depending on the film selected, window orientation, and sun exposure. All films we install come with manufacturer warranties covering fading, peeling, bubbling, and adhesive failure. We also provide a separate labor warranty on every installation.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What does glare reduction window film cost in Philadelphia?',
    answer: 'Cost varies by the number of windows, film type selected, and window accessibility. Residential installations typically range from a few hundred to a few thousand dollars total. Commercial projects are quoted by the square foot. We provide free no-obligation estimates for all Philadelphia-area properties including Center City, Main Line, South Jersey, and surrounding suburbs.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What is the best glare reduction film for south-facing windows?',
    answer: 'South-facing windows receive the most consistent direct sun throughout the day. We typically recommend a spectrally selective or dual-purpose solar + glare film for south exposures - these filter glare-causing wavelengths while also rejecting significant solar heat. The National Fenestration Rating Council (NFRC) rates these films for Visible Light Transmittance (VLT) so you get predictable, measurable results. We assess your specific window, glass type, and interior use during your free consultation.',
  },
];

const benefits = [
  {
    title: 'Eliminates Screen Glare on TVs and Computers',
    desc: 'Harsh reflections on televisions and computer monitors make content hard to see and strain your eyes. Our glare-control films filter out the specific wavelengths that create screen glare - so you see clearly without closing blinds or turning off lights.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Reduces Eye Strain for All-Day Comfort',
    desc: 'Whether you are working from home or running a Philadelphia office, chronic eye strain from glare takes a real toll on productivity and wellbeing. Film eliminates the constant squinting and headaches that come with untreated windows.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Maintains Natural Light Without the Harsh Glare',
    desc: 'Unlike heavy window tints that darken a room, our glare-reduction films preserve ample natural daylight while selectively filtering glare-causing wavelengths. You get all the benefits of natural light - without any of the discomfort.',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  serviceName="Glare Reduction Window Film"
  serviceDesc="Philadelphia window film that eliminates screen glare on TVs and computers, reduces eye strain, and maintains natural light."
  serviceUrl="https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/benefits/glare-reduction/"
  faqItems={faqItems}
>

  <!-- ══ SCHEMA: BreadcrumbList ══ -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "@id": "https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/benefits/glare-reduction/#breadcrumb",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Benefits", "item": "https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/benefits/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Glare Reduction Window Film Philadelphia", "item": "https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/benefits/glare-reduction/" }
    ]
  })}></script>

  <!-- ══ SCHEMA: WebPage + Speakable ══ -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "@id": "https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/benefits/glare-reduction/#webpage",
    "url": "https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/benefits/glare-reduction/",
    "name": "Glare Reduction Window Film for Philadelphia | Eliminate Screen Glare",
    "description": "Glare reduction window film for Philadelphia reduces up to 85% of screen glare depending on film selected, preserves natural daylight, and reduces eye strain. Free estimate.",
    "dateModified": "2026-07-02",
    "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebSite", "@id": "https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/#website", "url": "https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/", "name": "Window Film Philadelphia" },
    "breadcrumb": { "@id": "https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/benefits/glare-reduction/#breadcrumb" },
    "speakable": {
      "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
      "cssSelector": [".gr-geo__answer", ".gr-hero__subtitle", ".gr-whatis__direct-answer", ".gr-why__intro", ".swt-faq__a p"]
    },
    "about": { "@type": "Service", "@id": "https://windowfilmphiladelphia.net/benefits/glare-reduction/#service" }
  })}></script>

  <!-- ══ SCHEMA: Service ItemList (film types) ══ -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "ItemList",
    "name": "Glare Reduction Window Film Types Available in Philadelphia",
    "description": "Professional glare reduction window film options for Philadelphia homes and businesses, installed by certified technicians.",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Solar Control Film", "description": "Reduces glare and solar heat in a single film. The foundational window film category used by 3M, LLumar, Vista, and Solar Gard u2014 ideal for Philadelphia homes and commercial spaces." },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Spectrally Selective Film", "description": "Maximum daylight with minimum glare. Filters the visible wavelengths responsible for eye strain while preserving natural light in Philadelphia interiors." },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Ceramic Film", "description": "Non-metallic nanoceramic film that blocks glare and heat without a mirror effect, signal interference, or metallic exterior appearance. Ideal for Philadelphia condos, historic buildings, and HOA-restricted properties." },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "name": "Dual-Reflective Film", "description": "Different interior and exterior reflectance levels preserve your outward view while eliminating interior glare. Used in 3M Night Vision and Vista V-Series lines." }
    ]
  })}></script>

  <!-- ══ GEO: Key Takeaway ══ -->

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 1 - HERO
  ══════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="gr-hero">
    <div
      class="gr-hero__bg"
      style="background-image: url('/images/glare-reduction-window-film-philadelphia-hero.jpg')"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Glare reduction window film applied to a Philadelphia home office, eliminating harsh screen glare"
    ></div>
    <div class="gr-hero__overlay"></div>

    <div class="gr-hero__content">

      <div class="gr-hero__eyebrow">
        <span>Glare Reduction</span>
        <span class="gr-hero__eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Philadelphia, PA</span>
        <span class="gr-hero__eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Since 2008</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="gr-hero__title">Glare Reduction Window Film<br class="gr-hero__br"/> for Philadelphia</h1>

      <p class="gr-hero__animated-line">
        No more squinting in
        <FlipWords
          words={["home offices", "living rooms", "conference rooms", "classrooms", "sunrooms"]}
          staticText=""
          class="gr-hero__flip"
        />.
      </p>

      <p class="gr-hero__subtitle">
        Glare reduction window film for Philadelphia homes and offices eliminates screen glare on TVs and computers, reduces eye strain, and keeps natural light flowing in - no closed blinds required.
      </p>

      <div class="gr-hero__cta">
        <a href="/contact/" class="gr-hero__btn-primary">Get Your Free Estimate</a>
        <a href="tel:2673947980" class="gr-hero__btn-secondary">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.01 15.38c-1.23 0-2.42-.2-3.53-.56-.35-.12-.74-.03-1.01.24l-1.57 1.97c-2.83-1.35-5.48-3.9-6.89-6.83l1.95-1.66c.27-.28.35-.67.24-1.02-.37-1.11-.56-2.3-.56-3.53 0-.54-.45-.99-.99-.99H4.19C3.65 3 3 3.24 3 3.99 3 13.28 10.73 21 20.01 21c.71 0 .99-.63.99-1.18v-3.45c0-.54-.45-.99-.99-.99z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          Call (267) 394-7980
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="gr-hero__stats-panel" aria-label="Key statistics">
        <div class="gr-hero__stats-inner">
          <div class="gr-hero__stat">
            <span class="gr-hero__stat-number">85%</span>
            <span class="gr-hero__stat-label">Max Glare Reduced</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gr-hero__stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="gr-hero__stat">
            <span class="gr-hero__stat-number">2008</span>
            <span class="gr-hero__stat-label">Serving Philadelphia Since</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gr-hero__stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="gr-hero__stat">
            <span class="gr-hero__stat-number">500+</span>
            <span class="gr-hero__stat-label">Projects Completed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gr-hero__stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="gr-hero__stat">
            <span class="gr-hero__stat-number">Day 1</span>
            <span class="gr-hero__stat-label">Immediate Results</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="swt-body">

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════
         SECTION 2 - TRUST BAR
    ══════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="swt-trust">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="swt-trust__label">Trusted by 500+ Philadelphia homes and businesses</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <BrandLogos />

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════
         SECTION 3 - WHAT IS GLARE FILM
    ══════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="gr-whatis">
      <div class="gr-whatis__container">
        <div class="gr-whatis__content">
          <span class="gr-whatis__eyebrow">What Is Glare Reduction Film?</span>
          <h2 class="gr-whatis__title">A Thin Film. A Dramatic Difference.</h2>
          <p class="gr-whatis__direct-answer">
            Glare reduction window film for Philadelphia homes and offices is a professionally applied polyester film that selectively filters the visible light wavelengths responsible for screen reflections, eye strain, and harsh brightness - without blocking natural daylight or obscuring your view.
          </p>
          <p class="gr-whatis__body">
            Films are rated by the National Fenestration Rating Council (NFRC) for Visible Light Transmission (VLT), solar heat gain, and UV rejection. Spectrally selective technology allows today's glare-control films to target the exact wavelengths your eyes find uncomfortable while passing the softer, diffused light that makes a room feel airy and bright.
          </p>
          <p class="gr-whatis__body">
            Unlike heavy tints or blinds, professionally installed glare reduction window film for Philadelphia's east- and west-facing windows works around the clock - no adjustment required. Pair it with heat rejection for even greater comfort and lower energy bills: see how <a href="/benefits/energy-savings/">energy-saving window film for Philadelphia</a> tackles solar heat at the same time.
          </p>
          <div class="gr-whatis__stats">
            <div class="gr-whatis__stat"><strong>Day 1</strong><span>Immediate glare relief</span></div>
            <div class="gr-whatis__stat-div"></div>
            <div class="gr-whatis__stat"><strong>15-70%</strong><span>VLT range (NFRC-rated)</span></div>
            <div class="gr-whatis__stat-div"></div>
            <div class="gr-whatis__stat"><strong>15+ yrs</strong><span>Film lifespan with warranty</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gr-whatis__image-wrap">
          <img
            src="/images/glare-reduction-window-film-philadelphia-whatis.jpg"
            alt="Elegant Philadelphia interior with clear comfortable natural daylight after glare reduction window film installation - no harsh reflections, person working at desk near bright window" title="Elegant Philadelphia interior with clear comfortable natural daylight after glare reduction window film installation - no harsh reflections, person working at desk near bright window"
            class="gr-whatis__image"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════
         SECTION 4 - WHY IT MATTERS / PROBLEM
    ══════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="gr-why" id="problem">
      <div class="gr-why__container">

        <!-- Left: image with floating stat card -->
        <div class="gr-why__image-wrap">
          <img
            src="/images/glare-reduction-window-film-philadelphia-problem.jpg"
            alt="Philadelphia living room with west-facing windows creating harsh afternoon glare across TV screen and sofa - showing why glare reduction window film is needed" title="Philadelphia living room with west-facing windows creating harsh afternoon glare across TV screen and sofa - showing why glare reduction window film is needed"
            width="720"
            height="900"
            loading="lazy"
            class="gr-why__image"
          />
          <div class="gr-why__stat-card">
            <div class="gr-why__stat-item">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              <span>Up to 85% glare filtered (film-dependent)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="gr-why__stat-divider"></div>
            <div class="gr-why__stat-item">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              <span>Natural light preserved</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: content -->
        <div class="gr-why__content">
          <div class="eyebrow-modern">Why It Matters</div>
          <h2 class="gr-why__headline">Philadelphia's Sunniest Rooms Are Its Most Uncomfortable</h2>
          <p class="gr-why__intro">
            Philadelphia receives approximately 2,500 hours of sunshine annually. East- and west-facing windows create persistent morning and afternoon glare that hits screens, sofas, and workspaces at the worst possible angles. You end up closing blinds, which defeats the entire purpose of having windows. Glare reduction window film for Philadelphia's homes and offices solves this at the glass - permanently.
          </p>
          <ul class="gr-why__bullets">
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Screen glare on TVs and computers makes them nearly unusable during daylight hours
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Chronic eye strain and headaches reduce productivity in home offices and commercial spaces
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Closing blinds to block glare also blocks the natural light and views you paid for
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Solar gain through unprotected glass contributes significantly to HVAC load - glare reduction window film cuts both discomfort and cooling costs at once
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="gr-why__climate-facts">
            <div class="gr-why__climate-item">
              <span class="gr-why__climate-num">2,500</span>
              <span class="gr-why__climate-label">Sunshine hours/year in Philadelphia</span>
            </div>
            <div class="gr-why__climate-item">
              <span class="gr-why__climate-num">E/W</span>
              <span class="gr-why__climate-label">Windows = afternoon glare peak hours</span>
            </div>
            <div class="gr-why__climate-item">
              <span class="gr-why__climate-num">15-70%</span>
              <span class="gr-why__climate-label">VLT range - matched to your exposure</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="gr-why__closing">Since 2008, Window Film Philadelphia has helped homeowners and businesses across the Delaware Valley reclaim their glare-filled rooms. Every glare reduction window film installation we complete is backed by manufacturer and labor warranties - lasting results, not just a first impression.</p>
          <a href="/contact/" class="gr-why__cta">
            Get a free glare assessment →
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12h15m0 0l-6.75-6.75M19.5 12l-6.75 6.75"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════
         SECTION 5 - COMPACT BENTO BAND
    ══════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="gr-bento">
      <div class="gr-bento__header">
        <h2 class="gr-bento__title">How does glare reduction film work without losing natural light?</h2>
        <p class="gr-bento__sub">Glare reduction window film for Philadelphia delivers immediate, measurable results - without darkening your space, sacrificing your view, or requiring any ongoing adjustment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gr-bento__compact">

        <div class="gr-bento-item">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="9" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M14 7v2M14 19v2M7 14h2M19 14h2" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="3" fill="#7CB342" fill-opacity="0.15" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h3 class="gr-bento-item__title">Up to 85% Glare Reduced</h3>
            <p class="gr-bento-item__text">Screen reflections vanish from TVs, monitors, and glass surfaces - immediately after professional installation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gr-bento-item">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="4" y="6" width="20" height="16" rx="2" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M9 14h10M9 18h6" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M12 6V4M16 6V4" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h3 class="gr-bento-item__title">Natural Light Preserved</h3>
            <p class="gr-bento-item__text">Daylight stays. Glare goes. Spectrally selective film targets only the wavelengths your eyes find uncomfortable.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gr-bento-item">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="5" width="22" height="18" rx="2" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M3 11h22" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.4"/>
            <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="1.5" fill="#7CB342" opacity="0.6"/>
            <circle cx="13" cy="8" r="1.5" fill="#7CB342" opacity="0.6"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h3 class="gr-bento-item__title">Works on Any Glass</h3>
            <p class="gr-bento-item__text">Standard windows, skylights, glass doors, floor-to-ceiling curtain walls - glare reduction film works on any glazing type.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════
         SECTION 6 - KEY BENEFITS BENTO GRID
    ══════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="kb-section">
      <div class="kb-section__container">

        <div class="kb-section__header">
          <div class="eyebrow-modern">Key Benefits</div>
          <h2 class="kb-section__headline">What Glare Reduction Window Film Does for Philadelphia Spaces</h2>
          <p class="kb-section__sub">From home offices to Center City conference rooms - Philadelphia's glare problem has an elegant, permanent solution.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="kb-grid">

          <!-- Card 1: Hero - 85% Glare Filtered -->
          <div class="kb-card kb-card--hero">
            <div class="kb-card__hero-icon">
              <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
                <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M24 6v4M24 38v4M6 24h4M38 24h4M10.1 10.1l2.83 2.83M35.07 35.07l2.83 2.83M10.1 37.9l2.83-2.83M35.07 12.93l2.83-2.83" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="kb-card__hero-title">Up to 85% Glare Reduced On Day One</h3>
            <p class="kb-card__hero-text">Glare reduction window film for Philadelphia's sun-drenched homes and offices immediately reduces glare-causing visible light by up to 85% depending on film selected - without darkening the room or blocking your view. Results are immediate, lasting 15+ years with warranty coverage.</p>
            <div class="kb-card__pill">Immediate Results</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2: Home Office - photo -->
          <div class="kb-card kb-card--photo">
            <img
              src="/images/glare-reduction-film-philadelphia-kb-home-office.jpg"
              alt="Philadelphia home office worker at computer desk near large window, comfortable and focused without glare, glare reduction window film installed" title="Philadelphia home office worker at computer desk near large window, comfortable and focused without glare, glare reduction window film installed"
              width="400"
              height="560"
              loading="lazy"
              class="kb-card__img"
            />
            <div class="kb-card__photo-overlay"></div>
            <div class="kb-card__photo-content">
              <h3 class="kb-card__photo-title">Home Office Comfort</h3>
              <p class="kb-card__photo-text">Work from home without closing blinds or squinting at your screen.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3: Living Room TV - photo -->
          <div class="kb-card kb-card--photo">
            <img
              src="/images/glare-reduction-film-philadelphia-kb-living-room.jpg"
              alt="Philadelphia living room with large TV showing crisp clear picture, no glare or reflections from windows, comfortable light after glare reduction film" title="Philadelphia living room with large TV showing crisp clear picture, no glare or reflections from windows, comfortable light after glare reduction film"
              width="400"
              height="560"
              loading="lazy"
              class="kb-card__img"
            />
            <div class="kb-card__photo-overlay"></div>
            <div class="kb-card__photo-content">
              <h3 class="kb-card__photo-title">Living Room TV</h3>
              <p class="kb-card__photo-text">Watch TV clearly in the afternoon. No reflections. No closed blinds.</p>
            </div>
